{"synopsis":"Luo Zheng anak dari keluarga utama Luo keluarga yang dikhianati oleh keluarga cabang dan sampai membuat dirinya menjadi budak\nDemi menyelamatkan adiknya Luo Zheng memasuki jalan seni beladiri dan berusaha menjadi lebih kuat\nBertahuntahun berlalu Luo zheng telah melewati segala rintangan yang menghadang di depannya dan berhasil menyelamatkan adiknya Luo Yan\nNamun perjalanan Luo Zheng tidak sampai di sana dia masih harus menghadapi dunia yang jauh lebih besar dari yang dibayangkannya\nApa Luo Zheng akan berhasil mencapai puncak tertinggi dalam seni beladiri di seluruh dunia yang didatanginya","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"Ranzai Studio","artist":"Ranzai Studio","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"edc0aed4-8f1a-4c45-a332-be11f2795b5c","number":"1301","chapter":"1301","title":"","date":"2025-06-10","released":"2025-06-10"},{"chapter_id":"680a20e5-b4f7-453d-b8be-7e430773150a","number":"1300","chapter":"1300","title":"","date":"2025-06-04","released":"2025-06-04"},{"chapter_id":"65e45517-e38f-4053-bf70-228242b3fab6","number":"1299","chapter":"1299","title":"","date":"2025-05-29","released":"2025-05-29"},{"chapter_id":"f41845e5-df72-478a-8d06-39cc751087b4","number":"1298","chapter":"1298","title":"","date":"2025-05-22","released":"2025-05-22"},{"chapter_id":"0f5832f3-c898-4c7f-8250-6125e9d4cf88","number":"1297","chapter":"1297","title":"","date":"2025-05-20","released":"2025-05-20"},{"chapter_id":"054dfc03-da05-4e9b-a7b8-5c7026719bb8","number":"1296","chapter":"1296","title":"","date":"2025-05-15","released":"2025-05-15"},{"chapter_id":"1a042b1d-1e22-428b-9754-0dcbf4d1d497","number":"1295","chapter":"1295","title":"","date":"2025-05-09","released":"2025-05-09"},{"chapter_id":"bf16d4dd-4725-4cd4-b80f-a07f9bcc95b1","number":"1294","chapter":"1294","title":"","date":"2025-05-07","released":"2025-05-07"},{"chapter_id":"5fae67f1-02ea-403d-b4c7-5d2d6c9cfaa6","number":"1293","chapter":"1293","title":"","date":"2025-05-02","released":"2025-05-02"},{"chapter_id":"